  "final_answer": "I have gathered all the key specifications. Let me compile the findings.\n\n**Latest iPad Model Specifications (iPad 11-inch)**\n\nThe latest standard iPad model from Apple is the **iPad 11-inch**. Here are the specifications:\n\n### Storage Options\n- 128GB\n- 256GB\n- 512GB\n\n### Processor / Chip\n- **A16 chip**\n- 5-core CPU\n- 4-core GPU\n- 16-core Neural Engine\n\n### Display Features\n- **11-inch Liquid Retina display** (10.86 inches measured diagonally as a rectangle due to rounded corners)\n- LED backlit Multi-Touch display with IPS technology\n- **Resolution**: 2360-by-1640 pixels at **264 ppi**\n- **True Tone** technology\n- **500 nits brightness**\n- Fingerprint-resistant oleophobic coating\n- **Apple Pencil support**: Works with Apple Pencil (USB-C) and Apple Pencil (1st generation)\n\n### Additional Details (for completeness)\n- **Finishes available**: Silver, Blue, Pink, Yellow\n- **Size**: 9.79 inches (248.6 mm) × 7.07 inches (179.5 mm)\n- **Camera**: 12MP Wide camera with ƒ/1.8 aperture, 4K video recording at 24/25/30/60 fps\n\nThe information was verified by navigating to apple.com → iPad → Tech Specs on the official Apple website.",
